2025-04-11 16:33:40,370 - app.api.chatbot - INFO - Agent: Researcher, Content: Here are some Math courses available in Sydney for 2023:

1. **University of New South Wales (UNSW)**
   - **Postgraduate Courses:** The School of Mathematics offers a variety of postgraduate courses, details for which can be found on the UNSW website. These include the Data Science & Decisions program among others.
     - [More Details](https://www.unsw.edu.au/science/our-schools/maths/student-life-resources/postgraduate-coursework/postgraduate-courses/2023-postgrad-courses)
   - **Undergraduate Courses:** Courses like MATH1081 Discrete Mathematics are available, which is recommended for students majoring in Mathematics.
     - [More Details](https://www.unsw.edu.au/science/our-schools/maths/student-life-resources/undergraduate/undergraduate-courses)

2. **University of Sydney**
   - **MATH2023:** This course focuses on analysis and its fundamental role in mathematics, covering topics like calculus, limits, and series.
     - [Course Information](https://www.sydney.edu.au/units/MATH2023)
   - **Various Undergraduate Units:** Courses such as MATH1021 Calculus of One Variable, MATH1023 Multivariable Calculus and Modelling, and MATH1002 Linear Algebra, among others, are available for undergraduate students.
     - [More Details](https://www.maths.usyd.edu.au/u/UG/JM/)

These resources should help you explore a variety of mathematical topics depending on your academic or career needs.
